{"id":"rozlad-square","name":"Rozlad Square","type":"location","aliases":[],"description":"A dark Golgari-turf plaza near the tunnels of the Stonefare, where petrified victims are displayed.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2014-03-12","last_seen":"2014-03-12","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Gorgon and the Guildpact","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Doug Beyer"],"date":"2014-03-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Gorgon and the Guildpact\" by Doug Beyer. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Mar 2014."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12-e4","era":null,"summary":"Jace meets a hooded woman with a dagger in the square; she is petrified before he can read her mind.","participants":["jace-beleren","vraska-s-assassin-victim"],"location":"rozlad-square","importance":"minor","page":"stories/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","order":434,"story_date":"2014-03-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":59,"quote":"She became a stone statue before his eyes, a lifeless object.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12#:~:text=She%20became%20a%20stone,eyes%2C%20a%20lifeless%20object.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Gorgon and the Guildpact","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Doug Beyer"],"date":"2014-03-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12#:~:text=She%20became%20a%20stone,eyes%2C%20a%20lifeless%20object.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Gorgon and the Guildpact\" by Doug Beyer. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Mar 2014."}},{"id":"gorg