rgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12#:~:text=Instead%20of%20turning%20to,melted%20away%20into%20nothingness.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Gorgon and the Guildpact\" by Doug Beyer. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Mar 2014."}},{"id":"gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12-e7","era":null,"summary":"The real Jace emerges and has Vraska send her four assassins away; he deduces she wants to control him as Guildpact.","participants":["jace-beleren","vraska","milada","kobrev","zdenya","dibor"],"location":"rozlad-square","importance":"minor","page":"stories/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","order":434,"story_date":"2014-03-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":87,"quote":"So you want to leave me in the office of the Guildpact, and manipulate me.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12#:~:text=So%20you%20want%20to,Guildpact%2C%20and%20manipulate%20me.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Gorgon and the Guildpact","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Doug Beyer"],"date":"2014-03-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12#:~:text=So%20you%20want%20to,Guildpact%2C%20and%20manipulate%20me.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Gorgon and the Guildpact\" by Doug Beyer. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Mar 2014."}},{"id":"gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12-e8","era":null,"summary":"Vraska threatens Jace's allies and mentions Garruk Wildspeaker, hinting that something has happened to him, and tells Jace he is a plague.","participants":["vraska","jace-beleren","garruk-wildspeaker","emmara-tandris","kallist-rhoka","kavin"],"location":"rozlad-square","importance":"major","page":"stories/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","order":434,"story_date":"2014-03-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":100,"quote":"You're a plague, Beleren. A scourge to all those you claim to protect.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12#:~:text=You%27re%20a%20plague%2C%20Beleren.,you%20claim%20to%20protect.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Gorgon and the Guildpact","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Doug Beyer"],"date":"2014-03-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12#:~:text=You%27re%20a%20plague%2C%20Beleren.,you%20claim%20to%20protect.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Gorgon and the Guildpact\" by Doug Beyer. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Mar 2014."}},{"id":"gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12-e9","era":null,"summary":"Vraska strangles Jace with her tendrils; he reads her mind and conjures illusions of himself that attack her.","participants":["vraska","jace-beleren"],"location":"rozlad-square","importance":"minor","page":"stories/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","order":434,"story_date":"2014-03-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":105,"quote":"Jace felt the gorgon's grip loosen as he sent image after image of himself at her.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12#:~:text=Jace%20felt%20the%20gorgon%27s,of%20himself%20at%20her.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Gorgon and the Guildpact","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Doug Beyer"],"date":"2014-03-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12#:~:text=Jace%20felt%20the%20gorgon%27s,of%20himself%20at%20her.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Gorgon and the Guildpact\" by Doug Beyer. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Mar 2014."}},{"id":"gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12-e10","era":null,"summary":"Vraska petrifies the illusions, which become a cage around her, and the statues speak in Jace's voice and trick her into explaining her plan to take over Ravnica.","participants":["vraska","jace-beleren"],"location":"rozlad-square","importance":"major","page":"stories/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","order":434,"story_date":"2014-03-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":115,"quote":"Then, one by one, I will assassinate the guild leaders.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12#:~:text=Then%2C%20one%20by%20one%2C,assassinate%20the%20guild%20leaders.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Gorgon and the Guildpact","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Doug Beyer"],"date":"2014-03-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12#:~:text=Then%2C%20one%20by%20one%2C,assassinate%20the%20guild%20leaders.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Gorgon and the Guildpact\" by Doug Beyer. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Mar 2014."}},{"id":"gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12-e12","era":null,"summary":"Vraska crushes what she thinks is Jace's neck but it is her own petrified assassin; the statues close in and she blasts them away and planeswalks off.","participants":["vraska","jace-beleren"],"location":"rozlad-square","importance":"major","page":"stories/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","order":434,"story_date":"2014-03-12","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":126,"quote":"Then she took a breath, closed her eyes, and planeswalked away.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12#:~:text=Then%20she%20took%20a,eyes%2C%20and%20planeswalked%20away.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Gorgon and the Guildpact","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Doug Beyer"],"date":"2014-03-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12#:~:text=Then%20she%20took%20a,eyes%2C%20and%20planeswalked%20away.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Gorgon and the Guildpact\" by Doug Beyer. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Mar 2014."}}],"relations":[{"page":"stories/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","order":434,"story_date":"2014-03-12","storyline":"","source":"rozlad-square","id":"gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12-r5","relation":"located_in","target":"golgari-swarm","note":"Rozlad Square is Golgari turf.","paragraph":22,"quote":"Golgari turf. Near the tunnels of the Stonefare.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12#:~:text=Golgari%20turf.%20Near%20the%20tunnels%20of%20the%20Stonefare.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Gorgon and the Guildpact","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Doug Beyer"],"date":"2014-03-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12#:~:text=Golgari%20turf.%20Near%20the%20tunnels%20of%20the%20Stonefare.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Gorgon and the Guildpact\" by Doug Beyer. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Mar 2014."}}],"pages_say":[{"page":"stories/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","order":434,"story_date":"2014-03-12","presence":"appears","source":"wizards","description":"A dark Golgari-turf plaza near the tunnels of the Stonefare, where petrified victims are displayed.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Gorgon and the Guildpact","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Doug Beyer"],"date":"2014-03-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gorgon-and-guildpact-2014-03-12","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Gorgon and the Guildpact\" by Doug Beyer. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Mar 2014."}}]}
